Package: kmod-wireguard
Version: 6.6.104-r1
Depends: kernel (=6.6.104~02889c0e4a5ec5621bc920e5e2a32cc8-r1), kmod-crypto-lib-chacha20poly1305, kmod-crypto-lib-curve25519, kmod-udptunnel4, kmod-udptunnel6
